        <mxCell id="c3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#545B64;" value="One Lambda package behind one HTTP API, deployed twice (Messenger, Instagram); both run the same five steps. Terraform in terraform/, code in src/bot/, voice in persona/. Solid arrows: inside AWS. Dashed arrows: outside services. State as of 2026-11-08." vertex="1">
