        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#545B64;dashed=1;fontColor=#545B64;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" value="Bot Lambda, one package deployed twice: tlg-prod-messenger-bot and tlg-prod-instagram-bot (CHANNEL env). What each run does, left to right:" vertex="1">
