          <mxGeometry height="52" width="52" x="1360" y="560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c12" parent="1" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;" value="tlg-prod-messenger-bot" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="52" width="52" x="385" y="245" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c13" parent="1" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.lambda;" value="tlg-prod-instagram-bot" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="52" width="52" x="385" y="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c14" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F3;strokeColor=#545B64;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;align=center;" value="Baked in at deploy: persona/jess.md, voice-guide.md and vocabulary.md (written from the real message history) and the Terraform salon config (staff, services, prices, hours, booking links)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="62" width="380" x="480" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c15" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Receive and check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Verify Meta&#39;s signature, drop a duplicate delivery, fetch the client&#39;s name once, store and stay quiet if the sender is staff or the thread is locked to Jess." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="150" x="480" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c16" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Gather the persona&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;System prompt = jess.md + voice-guide.md + vocabulary.md + the salon config, then the thread so far and today&#39;s date and time." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="150" x="640" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c17" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EDE7F6;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Decide with Claude&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Opus 5.5 returns JSON: reply, escalate, who (jess, lori-dee, carmen), area, kind. Tools on Fresha: check availability, book, cancel, create client, patch-test status." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="150" x="800" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c18" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#7AA116;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Message the client&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Record the turn, show typing dots, wait until about 10 s have passed, send the reply through the Graph API. An opening message that is not ours gets nothing." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="150" x="960" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c19" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCE4EC;strokeColor=#E7157B;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Hand over when told&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lock the thread (quiet with Jess, watching with Lori-Dee or Carmen), one Telegram line to the team group, an SNS email record." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="150" x="1120" y="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
